<title>USA: Xerox cuts printer prices up to 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Xerox cuts printer prices up to 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xerox Corp said Monday it was reducing prices up to 21 percent across its full line of desktop monochrome laser printers.</p>
<p>Xerox also said it launched a major national advertising campaign, developed by Young &amp; Rubicam, showcasing the DocuPrint C55 Color Laser Printer.</p>
